  "description": "Baquera is a bold western-inspired display font with chunky, irregular letterforms and a rugged vintage character. Inspired by western signage, Americana, retro posters, and vintage branding, it brings a strong and nostalgic feel to creative projects.\nFeaturing 3 styles — Regular, Aged, and Rough — plus uppercase & lowercase letters, numbers, symbols, alternates, ligatures, and multilingual support, Baquera is perfect for posters, logos, branding, packaging, apparel, merchandise, café designs, and social media graphics.\nIncluded: OTF, TTF, uppercase & lowercase, numbers, punctuation, symbols, 3 styles, alternates, ligatures, and multilingual support.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Baquera is a bold western-inspired display font with chunky, irregular letterforms and a rugged vintage character. Inspired by western signage, Americana, retro posters, and vintage branding, it brings a strong and nostalgic feel to creative projects.</p>\n<p>Featuring 3 styles — Regular, Aged, and Rough — plus uppercase &amp; lowercase letters, numbers, symbols, alternates, ligatures, and multilingual support, Baquera is perfect for posters, logos, branding, packaging, apparel, merchandise, café designs, and social media graphics.</p>\n<p>Included: OTF, TTF, uppercase &amp; lowercase, numbers, punctuation, symbols, 3 styles, alternates, ligatures, and multilingual support.</p>",
